    "bambu-a1": {
        "_note": "Bambu Lab A1 (bed slinger, 256 x 256 x 256, like the P2S), 0.4 mm stainless steel nozzle, PLA on the Textured PEI plate. Speeds, accelerations, walls and temperatures from Bambu Studio's '0.20mm Standard @BBL A1' and 'Generic PLA @BBL A1'. Travel is 500 because the A1 firmware caps moves there (Bambu's profile asks for 700). The start G-code is resolved for PLA; see the CHANGE notes in it before printing other filaments. a1_project_settings.json was built from Bambu Studio's own A1 machine, process and filament profiles (Bambu Studio 02.08.02.61 keys); a plate you export from Bambu Studio for the A1 can replace it.",
        "inherits": "bambu-p2s",
        "startGcodeFile": "../../Library/Tests/Fabrication/Resources/Templates/bambu-a1/start.gcode",
